;;Name           Elevation  Type       Stage Data       Gated    Route To
;; The five 赤峰路 outlets discharge by gravity into the municipal storm
;; sewer (DN700): at every one the campus pipe invert is higher than the
;; municipal invert (+0.04 to +2.26 m), so the tailwater is a FIXED stage
;; set to the documented municipal pipe invert.  The three in-campus
;; 国康路 outfalls (YS6/YS7/YS8) feed the two pumping stations instead, and
;; the stations discharge through a force main to YS9 / YS10 on 国康路
;; (municipal DN1000).  Those two are written as FIXED-stage outfalls at
;; their documented invert.
